    "shyan18": "It was Twiggy, Kate Moss wasn't even born in the 60s.",
    "shyan21": "It's a song by the Beatles.",
    "shyan66": "Red Danny was the French students' riots leader in 1968.",
    "shyan24": "The Graduate is a movie by Mike Nichols starring Dustin Hoffman. It won an Oscar for Best Director in 1968.",
    "shyan27": "Neil Armstrong was the first man on the moon.",
    "shyan31": "It was Apollo 11 in 1969.",
    "shyan35": "She was the fashion designer who invented the miniskirt.",
    "shyan40": "It applies to the tense relationship between the Soviet Union and the United States.",
    "shyan44": "The United States of America was involved in the Vietnam War in the 60s.",
    "shyan52": "It's a film movement that appeared in France and included important directors like FranÃ§ois Trifault.",
