  "schema": 1,
  "provenance": "Hebrew transcribed visually from the 48 original question bitmap cards. Line breaks and spacing normalized. English translates those prompts. Intentionally false claims are preserved; answers and recordings still come from the original question.txt. Original question49 is not playable.",
