            "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Production4:3 high resolution game background: record shop close conversation camera. Image1 ORIGINAL close camera strictly defines geometry/crop and allobjectpositions. Image2 NEWwide room strictly defines same-room object designs/materials/palette, clean matte2Dink rendering. Freshly redraw every pixel, no legacy pixels upscaled. Exact source640x480 coordinates: left edge clipped bandphoto collage and orange-purple eye-flower mural; slim green carved stairpost atx190; diagonal wooden stairrail; empty stool partially cut atbottomleft x185; teal carved cabinet andorange vinylbins center-right, four small suited musician figurines aroundx340..430,y205; samegolden recorddisplay shelving upperright; foreground red suitcase turntable atx385..640,y220..432 andred/goldlava lamp atx490..560,y260..432. Keep left/center actor space empty; no Rick or any other character bakedin. Same physical cabinetry, lamp, albumcovers, wallpatterns and figurines as Image2, seen through Image1's closer camera. Original gray UI stripy432..480 is replaced with naturallycontinued lowercabinet/floor/recordplayer edges below, keep upper432pixels geometry unchanged, noverticalstretch. Output1448x1086, fine dark drawn contours, broad mattecolor planes andsimple coherent daylight, vibrant1960s atmosphere. Recreate allposter/albumillustrations fromnewwide consistently. No newtext, no extra clues/props, no UI, no border, no collageofoldpixels, nophotoreal orCGI.",
