            "sha256": "03a548e83061ff6119bc1cf214e7215b9c66afeb96f4ba34b6fcc60c4f84f2f4",
            "review": "New original-layout room reviewed natively in desktop/phone wide and close views, source writing/clue pickup/item use/exit, 20 actual camera/portrait pointer routes. Muted; remaining Susan action families and browser/device review pending. Fixes-80 (Audit 76 photo-part1/photo-part2 missing_vs_original, stories 1 and 2): an ANSCO counter placard is painted on the lower display shelf, standing behind the box camera and the twin-lens camera left of the KODAK'S poster; a 'SNAP' photo magazine (red masthead, camera-aperture cover graphic, cover-line bars, period stripes) with a brass magnifying glass lying over its cover lines lies on the counter left of the pencil cup (the original spot left of the phone is taken by the Ps11/le clue props and Susan's forearm); a white-bordered B&W mountain-lake print on warm ivory paper lies at the far-left counter end. Procedural painting in the counter's measured perspective (builds/fixes-80/photo-shop-decor/tools); no AI generation, no Legacy pixels; every other pixel unchanged. Fixes-81 (Audit 76 photo-part1/photo-part2 legacy_art_leak, stories 1 and 2): the six framed child photographs on the left wall (photo restorations of the Legacy photos) are replaced by six new sepia ink-and-wash portraits of different children (boy with a toy aeroplane, girl with a balloon, boy with round glasses and a bow tie, toddler hugging a kitten, laughing girl with a ponytail, laughing baby in a knitted bonnet), and the face in the round portrait above the door by a smiling boy in a sweater; new illustrations generated for this fix (builds/art-80/gen/portraits-v1.png, oval-portrait-v1.png), placed into the measured frame openings (side-wall frames through their perspective homography), toned to the room light with paper borders and the moulding's cel shadow; the flower spike stays in front of the girl-with-balloon frame and the ring, mat and painted floral frame of the round portrait are untouched (fixes-81/photo-portraits/tools); no Legacy pixels; every other pixel unchanged."
          }
        ]
      },
