        "review": "Fixes-78 (Audit 76 'Pink feather boa'): same Modern drawing re-matted (opaque interior, anti-aliased edge kept, specks removed), premultiplied Lanczos to 4x stage size, colour-padded transparent texels, mipmapped linear filter. Fixes the jagged near-black fringe from 7.8x un-mipmapped minification.",
