        "retouch": "Fixes-88 A5 (rooms rehearsal, record shop on the redesigned plate record-gpt-1-fixed2.png): the boa is feathers only. The ochre capital, the red slab above it and the cream/indigo shaft that the v1 painting drew inside the loop (3,875 sprite texels by the art director's rule, now 3 of feather highlights) are matted out on the v1 frame [0,4,710,2155]; the feathers they hid are repainted from the boa's own painted feathers (multi-scale PatchMatch, fill held opaque, free alpha only along the new silhouette, cross-fade over the old cut edges, a soft crevice tone where the back strand meets the front strand). The boa now hangs in front of the plate's own newel post; below the post's old cap the two strands touch, lower down they part and the plate shows between them. Then the unchanged fixes-78 re-matte and mipmap pass (alpha re-normalised, specks dropped, premultiplied Lanczos to 244x741, colour-padded transparent texels). Same file, size, frame, scene_rect and texture_filter; only texels x 27-122, y 81-597 change.",
        "retouch_tool": "builds/fixes-88/derived/tools/boa/make_boa_88.py (deterministic, seed 1; matte, repaint and re-matte of the existing Modern painting record-shop-scarf-modern-v1.png sha256 9846a23e...; no generator)"
      }
    },
