        "review": "Fixes-78 rework: rs1 (Veronica's handkerchief; channel 15, story 1 part 2 after #close_db12_cloths, while #can_take_rs1) lies flat across the back-right part of the restored ruled sheet and spills onto the floor, as in the original; 10 in square (0.91x the sheet's long edge), visible cloth 60x29 stage px, clear of the plinth foot. Replaces the squashed upright close-up page in the room."
