          "text": "PÄ›knÃ½! TeÄ vidÃ­m, Å¾e modrÃ¡ trubka vÃ¡Å¾Ã­ mÃ©nÄ›. PouÅ¾il jsi nÃ¡sobÃ­cÃ­ trik. PouÅ¾ili jste mnoho trubek, abyste zjistili hmotnost jednÃ© trubky. I kdyÅ¾ by mÄ› to taky mohlo napadnout, kdybych nebyl tak rozruÅ¡enÃ½.",
          "source_text": "Nice! Now I can see that the blue tube weighs less. You used a multiplication trick. You used many tubes to find the weight of one tube. Although I could have thought of that too if I wasn't so agitated.",
