        },
        "jmeab-20": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/jmeab-20.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "e91e5c50473e75bfa53c006f0ef7701d3b9e78ef53a6c20d7b9d77ccc8b0cf1e",
          "text": "co tu dÄ›lÃ¡m?",
          "source_text": "What am I doing here?",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "jmeab-21": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/jmeab-21.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "8a7e140535466c3840addff6aaa888f2115e3a8bd2d101e664495554eae45f7d",
          "text": "To musÃ­ bÃ½t mÅ¯j trest za to, Å¾e jsem se pÅ™Ã­liÅ¡ Äasto dÃ­val zpÄ›t do budoucnosti. TakÅ¾e, co mÃ¡m teÄ dÄ›lat?",
          "source_text": "This must be my punishment for watching back to the future too many times. So, what should I do now?",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-01": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-01.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "7548e1746b76ecd647ec46fa6094c81407045bcd04b0f91fdde38d21ac0db54b",
          "text": "VÃ­tejte, cestovateli. PrÃ¡vÄ› jste se dostali do Rockin' Sixties. MÃ­stnÃ­ Äas je zde 10:00, rok 1967, mÃ­sto San Francisco. Je lÃ©to lÃ¡sky.",
          "source_text": "Welcome time, traveler. You've just landed in the Rockin' Sixties. The local time here is 10 a.m., the year 1967, location San Francisco. It's the summer of love.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-02": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-02.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "36694424c2ebfa69e7eaabb5628ab4f71f4c7f3ffcec0def0ab2e037b3148725",
          "text": "Pamatujte, Å¾e si mÅ¯Å¾ete vybrat, zda nejprve najdete svÃ©ho otce nebo matku, ale kaÅ¾dÃ¡ cesta, kterou se rozhodnete jÃ­t, vÃ¡s zavede k jinÃ©mu pÅ™Ã­bÄ›hu.",
          "source_text": "Remember, you can choose to find either your father first or your mother, but each path you decide to take will lead you to a different story.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-03": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-03.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "a3654a8551c16e1f97d33f1bfad48afcdc188886ce7ecd354bb54baf434111a0",
          "text": "PÃ¡ni, zÃ¡vidÃ­m ti. 1967, San Francisco? Tak v pohodÄ›. Obchody, obleÄenÃ­? StaÄÃ­ jÃ­t dovnitÅ™ a zkontrolovat je.",
          "source_text": "Wow, I envy you. 1967, San Francisco? So cool. The shops, the clothes? You just have to go in and check them out.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-10": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-10.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "a2e0a5057f17d5c6b35475ccfd08962f11214376a9c9a0560e1f2b3825890dbc",
          "text": "Uh-oh, chtÄ›l jsem tÄ› poslat zpÃ¡tky do dneÅ¡nÃ­ho rÃ¡na, ne do roku 1967.",
          "source_text": "Uh-oh, I meant to send you back to this morning, not to 1967.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-20": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-20.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "291e163f82f8015446ff77f8e1e3fe0c69fff877a5b902a69edc1d3e6e95095b",
          "text": "Jejda, nÄ›co se v historii zmÄ›nilo. VaÅ¡i rodiÄe se mÄ›li setkat dnes veÄer, ale to se nestane. PÅ™eklad? To se ti nestane. MusÃ­te je pÅ™imÄ›t, aby se setkaly.",
          "source_text": "Oops, something in history has changed. Your parents were supposed to meet tonight, but it's not gonna happen. Translation? You're not going to happen. You have to make them meet.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-21": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-21.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "5f8040b5340bf75081b4efe34c8fd6a677a33204caa15f970855ed5deb97f1bc",
          "text": "Modlete se, myslÃ­m, Å¾ertuji. MusÃ­te mluvit s lidmi a zkoumat. ZÃ­skejte nÄ›jakÃ© stopy a informace.",
          "source_text": "Pray, I guess, just kidding. You need to talk to people and investigate. Get some clues and information.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-22a": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-22a.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "bb96e1cfa1bafeb9797c2966aeb1ed45e787cf267c02abbf4dca29036720d7ca",
          "text": "Alice Kaplan, vaÅ¡e matka, trÃ¡vÃ­ Äas v Bell's Cafe mezi vyuÄovÃ¡nÃ­m.",
          "source_text": "Alice Kaplan, your mother, spends her time at Bell's Cafe between classes.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
        "meab-22b": {
          "path": "res://assets/languages/cs/audio/meab-22b.mp3",
          "source": "Google Translate TTS (gTTS)",
          "sha256": "bf63c8bbaa4018c1cefa5c46de42afc25f72c02f941d661a3eeb4c15f66e9206",
          "text": "Jimmy Mackenzie, vÃ¡Å¡ otec, je slavnÃ½ reportÃ©r pracujÃ­cÃ­ pro noviny Guardian.",
          "source_text": "Jimmy Mackenzie, your father, is a famous reporter working for the Guardian newspaper.",
          "transcription_review_required": false
        },
