ào†qöJ3¹‹Ž„ØZÿàéc˜õþå¾Ga:‹rg	HéòýIÞ{|yßKü{ìâ•·Šÿ¾;SÆ~RÏ'<Šºæy^œ<Æj\]7EÙ)pºœòÕö_7s ÏŸ‹éùûiƒîªü}l_ãÇø/Þ¢äA/]:ið’Á~¯¥93ò'qìÓ­nü¼êâ	ø|Õmáß@á®Ø¹ó¹ÈŠOÎÿ—òW€Ã`üÚàskmÂÞáGÞ<É½ ³Çr5æýÊ*q6~¦ÀÍð]ÉmDº=¦ë#ëêµÖÝ×çŸªë±ÛI¬/9‚þ<\þfÒÛ¿s•)þVX~Ý=èfEHÇîaÔøùöGkù;ùfi¿¦ðI>=GŽ{ÉüV'{a$kÈ¬ŸÝÖÏãÒØd”GmÞþ½7ñ$íÄwMãùxàm‚1H²þ13ÆÜÇôol«+ãçä	ûD]gÚ°³ÉÈß&S÷êcä³ä7Ì¼ðúÈb= ä^qœ?Ê™õ9&k³šñÖÂä§Æ¯¿à=p¤ýs0Ö Ûû^¬ö€îèpk–n±77z
X‚ÿ{;ùV>Ët‰?sío2œçXšÇQè~Ñî“äÃ^h´/âÆh?Äwç¥íÌÙgé ¦î`à³X/9à%œ],7/¥N§ûïŸ®ƒÆ¡¹OÒ!]€™;dŒ¶k0c’,+`cÐi¿5âå(ß„ö?þõbWû½¯×ZXìzþeÊW¨»‹Ùkcz§ëÙÐp"]…%bÞÍ#ÚúÅ_‰ýá°ÿlx®N†7õ†ûZÞ£zó¼´;Dç¾R¹”ý¿³éAxc¹ÿ9HÏ.š;â|È%“±ë‹MFÖ{ÿâW~áÑsüs.rooúlÿŽzrDŽÔb‡ÀñKrÓ–†¨óaÎäÆÞÇÍÃè&ÇË¦F¼;1üB¹×ä‡Sí*Ñnp@Ž»aW–oFi´í×Ûœfe}C„žO|Ëd56²ÿHù=êõp¹­“{¾ãWäŸÀ\Í¼¹^ÌÛhUÝÁÝ;ÈÛ Xâß?Ò÷þ¤.+Ñ2?c™ÓÔÝ¼à£¶á¸'ÇýwQ=5Ü_]ß+lCÊ\Ðm5=*À_O´è"÷ÝêF␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀shader_type canvas_item;
varying vec4 item_tint;
void vertex() { item_tint = COLOR; }
render_mode unshaded;
uniform sampler2D neutral_image : source_color, filter_linear_mipmap, repeat_disable;
uniform sampler2D closed_image : source_color, filter_linear_mipmap, repeat_disable;
uniform vec2 source_size = vec2(1024.0,1536.0);
uniform vec4 eye_left_bounds;
uniform vec4 eye_right_bounds;
uniform vec2 eye_left_x;
uniform vec2 eye_right_x;
uniform float left_upper[9];
uniform float left_lower[9];
uniform float left_closed[9];
uniform float right_upper[9];
uniform float right_lower[9];
uniform float right_closed[9];
uniform float blink_amount : hint_range(0.0,1.0) = 0.0;
uniform vec4 brow_left_bounds;
uniform vec4 brow_right_bounds;
uniform vec2 brow_raise = vec2(0.0);
uniform float brow_furrow = 0.0;
uniform vec2 eye_lower_cleanup = vec2(6.0);
uniform float squint_amount : hint_range(0.0,0.6) = 0.0;
uniform bool progressive_skin_coverage = false;
uniform float eye_cleanup_roof = 0.0;
uniform float left_skin_margin[9];
uniform float right_skin_margin[9];
uniform vec2 left_lash_half_width = vec2(0.0);
uniform vec2 right_lash_half_width = vec2(0.0);
uniform float left_open_lash_center[9];
uniform float right_open_lash_center[9];
uniform float left_closed_lash_center[9];
uniform float right_closed_lash_center[9];
uniform bool left_neutral_lash_source = false;
uniform bool right_neutral_lash_source = false;

uniform bool layered_gaze_enabled = false;
uniform sampler2D iris_image : source_color, filter_linear_mipmap, repeat_disable;
uniform vec2 iris_image_size;
uniform vec4 iris_rect;
uniform vec2 gaze_left = vec2(0.0);
uniform vec2 gaze_right = vec2(0.0);
uniform vec2 gaze_left_x;
uniform vec2 gaze_right_x;
uniform float gaze_left_top[9];
uniform float gaze_left_bottom[9];
uniform float gaze_right_top[9];
uniform float gaze_right_bottom[9];
uniform vec4 gaze_left_iris;
uniform vec4 gaze_right_iris;
uniform vec2 gaze_left_white_sample;
uniform vec2 gaze_right_white_sample;

// Optional atlas registration. Landmarks stay in the neutral frame's pixels.
uniform bool frame_registration_enabled = false;
uniform vec2 neutral_image_size = vec2(1.0);
uniform vec2 closed_image_size = vec2(1.0);
uniform vec2 neutral_frame_origin = vec2(0.0);
uniform vec2 closed_frame_origin = vec2(0.0);
uniform vec3 closed_sample_row_0 = vec3(1.0,0.0,0.0);
uniform vec3 closed_sample_row_1 = vec3(0.0,1.0,0.0);
vec4 neutral_at(vec2 p) {
    if (!frame_registration_enabled) return texture(neutral_image,p/source_size);
    return texture(neutral_image,(neutral_frame_origin+p)/neutral_image_size);
}
vec4 closed_at(vec2 p) {
    if (!frame_registration_enabled) return texture(closed_image,p/source_size);
    vec3 q=vec3(p,1.0);
    vec2 registered=vec2(dot(closed_sample_row_0,q),dot(closed_sample_row_1,q));
    return texture(closed_image,(closed_frame_origin+registered)/closed_image_size);
}

float curve_value(int curve_id,int index) {
    int i=clamp(index,0,8);
    if(curve_id==0)return left_upper[i];
    if(curve_id==1)return left_lower[i];
    if(curve_id==2)return left_closed[i];
    if(curve_id==3)return right_upper[i];
    if(curve_id==4)return right_lower[i];
    if(curve_id==5)return right_closed[i];
    if(curve_id==6)return left_skin_margin[i];
    if(curve_id==7)return right_skin_margin[i];
    if(curve_id==8)return gaze_left_top[i];
    if(curve_id==9)return gaze_left_bottom[i];
    if(curve_id==10)return gaze_right_top[i];
    if(curve_id==11)return gaze_right_bottom[i];
    if(curve_id==12)return left_open_lash_center[i];
    if(curve_id==13)return right_open_lash_center[i];
    if(curve_id==14)return left_closed_lash_center[i];
    return right_closed_lash_center[i];
}
float curve9(float x, vec2 range_x, int curve_id) {
    float pos=clamp((x-range_x.x)/(range_x.y-range_x.x)*8.0,0.0,7.999);
    int i=int(floor(pos));
    float f=fract(pos);
    float a=curve_value(curve_id,i-1),b=curve_value(curve_id,i);
    float c=curve_value(curve_id,i+1),d=curve_value(curve_id,i+2);
    return 0.5*((2.0*b)+(-a+c)*f+(2.0*a-5.0*b+4.0*c-d)*f*f+(-a+3.0*b-3.0*c+d)*f*f*f);
}

float rect_mask(vec2 p,vec4 bounds,float feather) {
    vec2 edge=min(p-bounds.xy,bounds.xy+bounds.zw-p);
    return smoothstep(0.0,feather,min(edge.x,edge.y));
}

// A complete newly authored iris is independent of the eyelid artwork.
// Its center translates rigidly under a fixed, traced eyeball aperture.
vec3 layered_eye(vec2 p,vec3 base,int side) {
    if(!layered_gaze_enabled)return base;
    vec2 xs=side==0?gaze_left_x:gaze_right_x;
    if(p.x<xs.x-1.0 || p.x>xs.y+1.0)return base;
    float top=curve9(p.x,xs,8+side*2);
    float bottom=curve9(p.x,xs,9+side*2);
    float cover=smoothstep(-0.5,0.5,p.y-top)*(1.0-smoothstep(-0.5,0.5,p.y-bottom));
    cover*=smoothstep(xs.x-0.5,xs.x+0.5,p.x)*(1.0-smoothstep(xs.y-0.5,xs.y+0.5,p.x));
    if(cover<=0.0)return base;
    vec4 iris_geometry=side==0?gaze_left_iris:gaze_right_iris;
    vec2 offset=side==0?gaze_left:gaze_right;
    vec2 local=(p-iris_geometry.xy-offset)/iris_geometry.zw*0.5+0.5;
    vec4 iris=vec4(0.0);
    if(all(greaterThanEqual(local,vec2(0.0))) && all(lessThanEqual(local,vec2(1.0)))) {
        iris=texture(iris_image,(iris_rect.xy+local*iris_rect.zw)/iris_image_size);
    }
    vec2 white_sample=side==0?gaze_left_white_sample:gaze_right_white_sample;
    vec3 white=neutral_at(white_sample).rgb;
    float shade=mix(0.88,1.0,smoothstep(0.0,0.65,(p.y-top)/max(bottom-top,1.0)));
    vec3 eye=mix(white*shade,iris.rgb,iris.a);
    return mix(base,eye,cover);
}

vec3 blink_eye(vec2 p,vec3 base,int side) {
    vec2 xs=side==0?eye_left_x:eye_right_x;
    int curve_id=side*3;
    float top=curve9(p.x,xs,curve_id);
    float bottom=curve9(p.x,xs,curve_id+1);
    float seam=curve9(p.x,xs,curve_id+2);
    // A held expression needs neutral lid/skin continuity, not a frozen
    // intermediate closed-lid drawing. Move only the two lid contours; the
    // iris remains sampled at the unmodified source pixel in the aperture.
    if (squint_amount > 0.0) {
        float narrow=clamp(squint_amount,0.0,0.6);
        float narrowed_top=mix(top,seam,narrow);
        float narrowed_bottom=mix(bottom,seam,narrow);
        float unit=clamp((p.x-xs.x)/(xs.y-xs.x),0.0,1.0);
        float roof=top-(5.0+8.0*sin(unit*3.14159265));
        float cleanup=side==0?eye_lower_cleanup.x:eye_lower_cleanup.y;
        float floor_y=max(bottom,seam)+cleanup;
        vec2 source=p;
        if (p.y < narrowed_top && p.y > roof) {
            source.y=roof+(p.y-roof)*(top-roof)/max(0.001,narrowed_top-roof);
        } else if (p.y > narrowed_bottom && p.y < floor_y) {
            source.y=bottom+(p.y-narrowed_bottom)*(floor_y-bottom)/max(0.001,floor_y-narrowed_bottom);
        }
        float side_mask=smoothstep(xs.x-1.0,xs.x+1.0,p.x)*(1.0-smoothstep(xs.y-1.0,xs.y+1.0,p.x));
        vec3 neutral_lid=neutral_at(source).rgb;
        base=mix(base,layered_eye(source,neutral_lid,side),side_mask);
        top=narrowed_top;
        bottom=narrowed_bottom;
    }
    float amount=clamp(blink_amount,0.0,1.0);
    float moving_top=mix(top,seam,amount);
    float moving_bottom=mix(bottom,seam,amount);
    // The surviving aperture uses the neutral drawing at the exact same UV.
    // No iris translation, scale, squeeze, or open/closed image crossfade.
    float aperture=smoothstep(-0.35,0.45,p.y-moving_top)
       *(1.0-smoothstep(-0.45,0.35,p.y-moving_bottom));
    aperture*=1.0-smoothstep(0.985,1.0,amount);
    // Do not expose a second, stationary closed lash beneath the moving lid.
    // Lower-lid coverage borrows clean skin just below the authored seam.
    vec2 skin_pixel=p;
    if(p.y>moving_bottom)skin_pixel.y+=max(0.0,seam+curve9(p.x,xs,6+side)-moving_bottom);
    vec3 skin=closed_at(skin_pixel).rgb;
    float unit_x=clamp((p.x-xs.x)/(xs.y-xs.x),0.0,1.0);
    float expansion=max(3.0+8.0*sin(unit_x*3.14159265),eye_cleanup_roof);
    float x_mask=smoothstep(xs.x-1.0,xs.x+1.0,p.x)*(1.0-smoothstep(xs.y-1.0,xs.y+1.0,p.x));
    float cleanup_lower=side==0?eye_lower_cleanup.x:eye_lower_cleanup.y;
    float original_band=smoothstep(top-expansion-1.0,top-expansion+1.0,p.y)
       *(1.0-smoothstep(max(bottom,seam)+cleanup_lower-2.0,max(bottom,seam)+cleanup_lower,p.y));
    // Coverage becomes opaque as the lid crosses each iris pixel. Blending is
    // restricted to the subpixel edge and the initial ink replacement.
    float covered=(1.0-aperture)*original_band;
    if (progressive_skin_coverage) {
        // Newly occluded eye pixels need opaque skin; the surrounding painted
        // skin/eyeshadow must approach the authored closed state continuously.
        // This never blends two irises, heads or faces.
        float original_content=smoothstep(top-2.0,top,p.y)
            *(1.0-smoothstep(bottom,bottom+2.0,p.y));
        covered*=max(original_content,smoothstep(0.0,1.0,amount));
    }
    vec3 result=mix(base,skin,covered);
    // Move one authored lash/closed-lid seam with the upper lid. Sample the
    // closed source around its traced seam; it cannot add a second static row.
    float dy=p.y-moving_top;
    vec2 authored_width=side==0?left_lash_half_width:right_lash_half_width;
    if (authored_width.x>0.0 && authored_width.y>0.0) {
        // Aperture coverage and authored ink center are independent traces.
        // Thick neutral eyeliner must approach its own center/wing curvature.
        float original_center=curve9(p.x,xs,12+side);
        float ink_closed=curve9(p.x,xs,14+side);
        float open_center=original_center;
        open_center=mix(open_center,ink_closed,clamp(squint_amount,0.0,0.6));
        dy=p.y-mix(open_center,ink_closed,amount);
        float authored_ink_width=mix(authored_width.x,authored_width.y,amount);
        float sample_dy=dy*authored_width.y/max(authored_ink_width,0.001);
        vec3 authored_lash=closed_at(vec2(p.x,seam+sample_dy)).rgb;
        if(side==0?left_neutral_lash_source:right_neutral_lash_source) {
            // One authored neutral stroke follows the same geometric seam.
            // Its source sampling becomes the exact neutral pixel at amount0.
            float neutral_dy=dy*authored_width.x/max(authored_ink_width,0.001);
            authored_lash=neutral_at(vec2(p.x,original_center+neutral_dy)).rgb;
        }
        float authored_darkness=1.0-smoothstep(0.15,0.37,dot(authored_lash,vec3(0.299,0.587,0.114)));
        float authored_ink=authored_darkness*(1.0-smoothstep(authored_ink_width,authored_ink_width+1.0,abs(dy)));
        authored_ink*=smoothstep(0.0,0.025,amount);
        result=mix(result,authored_lash,authored_ink);
        return mix(base,result,x_mask*smoothstep(0.0,0.025,amount));
    }
    vec3 lash=closed_at(vec2(p.x,seam+dy)).rgb;
    float darkness=1.0-smoothstep(0.15,0.37,dot(lash,vec3(0.299,0.587,0.114)));
    float ink_width=mix(1.0,3.0,smoothstep(0.65,1.0,amount));
    float ink=darkness*(1.0-smoothstep(ink_width,ink_width+1.0,abs(dy)));
    ink*=smoothstep(0.0,0.08,amount);
    result=mix(result,lash,ink);
    return mix(base,result,x_mask*smoothstep(0.0,0.025,amount));
}

vec3 brow(vec2 p,vec3 base,vec4 bounds,float raise_amount,float furrow,bool left) {
    float mask=rect_mask(p,bounds,5.0);
    vec2 unit=(p-bounds.xy)/max(bounds.zw,vec2(1.0));
    float center=sin(clamp(unit.x,0.0,1.0)*3.14159265);
    float inner=left?smoothstep(0.25,0.85,unit.x):1.0-smoothstep(0.15,0.75,unit.x);
    vec2 displacement=vec2((left?-1.0:1.0)*furrow*0.15*inner,
        raise_amount*center-furrow*inner);
    displacement*=mask;
    vec3 shifted=neutral_at(p+displacement).rgb;
    return mix(base,shifted,mask);
}

void fragment() {
    // Draw-time guard also covers a Tween changing ancestor alpha after _process.
    if (item_tint.a < 0.9999) { discard; }
    vec2 p=UV*source_size;
    if (frame_registration_enabled) p=UV*neutral_image_size-neutral_frame_origin;
    float lb=rect_mask(p,brow_left_bounds,5.0);
    float rb=rect_mask(p,brow_right_bounds,5.0);
    float l=rect_mask(p,eye_left_bounds,2.0);
    float r=rect_mask(p,eye_right_bounds,2.0);
    float active_brow=step(0.001,abs(brow_raise.x)+abs(brow_raise.y)+abs(brow_furrow));
    float lid_activity=max(blink_amount,squint_amount);
    float active_eye=layered_gaze_enabled?1.0:step(0.0001,lid_activity);
    float support=max(max(l,r)*active_eye,max(lb,rb)*active_brow);
    // Most of this full-body quad is transparent. Avoid texture/contour work.
    if (support <= 0.0) { discard; }
    vec4 base=texture(neutral_image,UV);
    vec3 result=base.rgb;
    result=brow(p,result,brow_left_bounds,brow_raise.x,brow_furrow,true);
    result=brow(p,result,brow_right_bounds,brow_raise.y,brow_furrow,false);
    vec3 left_base=layered_eye(p,base.rgb,0);
    vec3 right_base=layered_eye(p,base.rgb,1);
    float eye_weight=layered_gaze_enabled?1.0:smoothstep(0.0,0.01,lid_activity);
    result+=(blink_eye(p,left_base,0)-base.rgb)*l*eye_weight;
    result+=(blink_eye(p,right_base,1)-base.rgb)*r*eye_weight;
    float alpha=support*base.a;
    COLOR=vec4(result,alpha)*item_tint;
}
