␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀shader_type canvas_item;
render_mode unshaded;
uniform float reveal=0.0;
void fragment(){
	vec4 ink=texture(TEXTURE,UV);
	float distance=reveal*2.15-UV.x-UV.y;
	float curl=exp(-pow(distance/0.07,2.0));
	ink.rgb=mix(ink.rgb,vec3(1.0,0.95,0.74),curl*0.30);
	ink.a*=smoothstep(-0.025,0.025,distance);
	COLOR=ink;
}
